	(text "RULES\n 1. Cap within 2 mm of its pin, same layer, no via between\n    cap and pin.\n 2. Cap ground pad -> its island -> via to L2. Not a shared\n    trace.\n 3. Keep pins 40-43 (COMH/COML) clear; place caps above and\n    below the daisy-chain exit, not in it.\n 4. Thermal pad (65): 36 vias to L2 GND plane, tented/plugged."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
